        "dual_definition": "F(lambda)=sum_i f_i^*((A lambda)_i), f_i^*(y)=c_i*y+y^2/(2*a_i); theta_i(lambda)=grad f_i^*((A lambda)_i)=c_i+(A lambda)_i/a_i",
